1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,635
Tinku bhaiya! Today we meet the boss! Start the game, quick!

2
00:00:04,685 --> 00:00:07,725
Which boss? I want to play too!

3
00:00:07,775 --> 00:00:12,375
Okay Pinky, all three of us go today! I'll load the saved game.

4
00:00:12,425 --> 00:00:17,080
I brought my bag of grains too. What if I get hungry?

5
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:20,710
Ha ha! Golu takes snacks everywhere!

6
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:23,320
Ready? Three... two... one... START!

7
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:26,820
Aaah! We're being pulled inside!

8
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:32,225
Wow! It's a city by the sea!

9
00:00:32,275 --> 00:00:34,795
And up there it says: BOSS LEVEL!

10
00:00:34,845 --> 00:00:37,810
Shhh... someone is behind the sandcastle...

11
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:39,160
Gutur-goo!

12
00:00:39,210 --> 00:00:41,775
Oh my! Such a GIANT pigeon!

13
00:00:41,825 --> 00:00:45,595
It's wearing a crown! It's the Pigeon King!

14
00:00:45,645 --> 00:00:48,385
Why is he looking at us so grumpily?

15
00:00:48,435 --> 00:00:51,960
Don't worry! I'll go and grab his crown!

16
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,450
Gutur-goo! Gutur-goo!

17
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,425
Whoa... whoa... his wings blew me away!

18
00:00:57,625 --> 00:01:00,965
Tinku crashed into the sandcastle! Ha ha!

19
00:01:01,015 --> 00:01:03,065
Ptooh! Sand in my mouth!

20
00:01:03,115 --> 00:01:07,120
My turn! I'll tickle him with this feather!

21
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:09,610
Gutur-goo! Gutur-goo!

22
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:12,675
Oof! He blew me away too!

23
00:01:13,075 --> 00:01:16,345
Wait! Where is that rumbly-grumbly sound coming from?

24
00:01:16,395 --> 00:01:19,310
It's the Pigeon King's tummy!

25
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:22,970
Ohh! You're hungry, aren't you? That's why you're grumpy!

26
00:01:23,020 --> 00:01:25,625
Here, have some grains from my bag!

27
00:01:26,425 --> 00:01:28,715
Gutur-goo! Gutur-goo!

28
00:01:28,765 --> 00:01:31,885
Look! The boss bar filled up with hearts!

29
00:01:31,935 --> 00:01:35,565
Golu, you won the boss level without any fight!

30
00:01:35,615 --> 00:01:38,735
The Pigeon King is my friend now! High five!

31
00:01:38,785 --> 00:01:40,185
Gutur-goo!

32
00:01:40,985 --> 00:01:44,130
Hey! He gave us a golden key!

33
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:46,610
It says: SECRET LEVEL!

34
00:01:46,660 --> 00:01:49,010
A secret level? Can we go now?

35
00:01:49,060 --> 00:01:52,580
Save the game for today! It's bedtime!

36
00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:56,665
Thud! We're back in the room!

37
00:01:56,715 --> 00:02:00,775
My bag is empty... but my heart is full!

38
00:02:00,875 --> 00:02:04,705
Next time: Pinky and the Secret Level!

39
00:02:04,755 --> 00:02:06,410
Bye-bye, friends!

40
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:08,090
Bye-bye!
